Hand-written revert of 8c9f44b6 against the current tree: a Group or Sequence member that
settled Excluded counts as failed for the Tasks After its container again (tally.go stops
folding it into the container's success via memberOutcome), and a Task a failed predecessor
keeps from running settles with the bare "not started" summary instead of the summary
stopperLocked names (eligibility.go placeLocked). Later edits to internal/project/present/ports.go
keep the commit's own hunks from reversing, so this removes the two graph behaviours both
guarding tests depend on.

